Package: Rwards
Version: 0.1.0
Title: Turn R Errors into Experience Points and Levels
Authors@R: c(
    person("Alexandre", "Fortier-Chouinard", role = "aut"),
    person("Mickael", "Temporão", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "m.temporao@sciencespobordeaux.fr"))
Description: Turns R errors into a game. Each error earns experience points,
    with a bonus the first time a given error is seen, and accumulated points
    raise the user through titled levels shown with a progress bar and an
    encouraging message. Progress is cached across sessions. The goal is to
    take the anxiety out of error messages and make learning R more engaging
    for newcomers.
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: crayon, progress
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
License: GPL-3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
